{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0574_1005_p", "source_sha256": "209e748aafaa707ac3f41eb32fa85312a882d8c510dbdb8fbd4088aac4d9af47", "ja": "それはよかった。着こなしも決まってるな。\nこれで思いっきりステージを駆け回ってくれ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0574_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "ce65e0fb79efd760acf81ffc083079ac94d08e7b2ff7450563d2b031d560a8ed", "ja": "モチのロンだよ！　ファンの兄ちゃんも姉ちゃんも、\nそれ以外も、バッチリ楽しませてみせるかんね！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0574_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "c032542b7192d9a1f44d59bdba2e26c708d79995e652218d9c8eb35be8b48dae", "ja": "なにしろ亜美は、ローニャクナンニョを魅了しちゃう\n天性のアイドルですからなぁ。ご存じないと思うけど。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0574_1008_p", "source_sha256": "42a799a5ec9079bb53ae3d47a68fb34f3cad09f12dd7aae34b0f4a9fd00c56a6", "ja": "いや、立場上亜美のことはいろいろご存じなつもりで\nいるんだけど……何かありそうだな、エピソードが。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0574_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "9045facfcad31ed70c722a4a07bec998c312608da97eacd203c5929e63984e5b", "ja": "ピンポンピンポーン！　いや～、こないだ家で\nアルバム見てたんだけどさ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0574_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "362ca5d88a40e8f5503d41dc2a5b60c70ea2c91dbcc92a67f93d0fc470fa14b1", "ja": "亜美と真美が赤ちゃんの時からの写真がいーっぱい\nあってね！　メチャかわなのはトーゼンなんだけど！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0574_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "87f9ce93be6674f2467d3bac70061c5f04baee3e3de37ac13f651cabb14f97f5", "ja": "亜美たち、いつも元気で、ハチャメチャで、\nよく動いてしゃべって、笑顔だったっぽいよー。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_011ami0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_011ami0574_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "6eb406ccc5b5f6ad13aafa3d7f9da51ecaa0b37d301739b2d279788cb6d92377", "ja": "これって、生まれた時から\nアイドルの素質があったってことっしょ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
